/dist

# Eval run output. Traces and reports are written to a new timestamped
# directory per invocation, and every trace embeds absolute workspace paths,
# session ids, and timestamps. Promote the runs worth keeping into
# /evals/baselines by hand. See evals/baselines/README.md.
/evals/artifacts
.pi
